  "definition": "Administrative Controls",
  "effectiveDate": "2022-07-26",
  "historyNote": "#6827, eff 8-6-98; ss by #8692, INTERIM, eff 7-27-06, EXPIRES: 2-2-07; ss by #8808, eff 1-24-07; ss by #10763, INTERIM, eff 1-23-15, EXPIRES: 7-22-15; ss by #10893, eff 7-21-15; para (c) amd by #12024, INTERIM, eff 10-28-16, EXPIRED: 4-26-17; para (c) amd by #12215, eff 6-20-17; ss by #13410, eff 7-26-22",
  "inScheme": "https://granitestate.github.io/rules/scheme",
